1
00:01:44,519 --> 00:01:45,760
If there are any objections,

2
00:01:46,439 --> 00:01:47,480
we'll stick to the old rules:

3
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:48,760
vote on it.

4
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,120
I vote to continue.

5
00:01:54,719 --> 00:01:56,760
I don't like how Sass is using us,

6
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,840
but what I can tolerate even less

7
00:01:58,879 --> 00:02:00,719
is being played by that old man and kid.

8
00:02:04,359 --> 00:02:07,439
I... I'm feeling a little dizzy,

9
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:10,319
and I haven't really felt like taking missions lately.

10
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,479
If you all agree

11
00:02:11,479 --> 00:02:13,000
to let me rest at home,

12
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,400
I might consider it.

13
00:02:19,039 --> 00:02:21,039
I gave you the most sensible option,

14
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:22,879
yet you're all being so stubborn.

15
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:36,599
Fine, fine. I'll play along to the end.

16
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:42,960
So are you saying

17
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,639
you want all of us to commit perjury?

18
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:46,919
What?

19
00:02:47,159 --> 00:02:48,080
Do you actually want to get dragged

20
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,840
into this crazy mess?

21
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:51,680
No.

22
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,919
Since the police have already

23
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:54,960
accepted this version of events,

24
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,159
the only thing we can do

25
00:02:56,159 --> 00:02:57,560
is report to headquarters

26
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:58,520
and tell them

27
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,800
they broke our hotel's rules,

28
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:03,360
so even if something happened at our hotel,

29
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,479
we're not liable.

30
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:06,520
So I think,

31
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,080
looking at the big picture,

32
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,199
the outcome is still pretty good.

33
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,199
Because none of our guests

34
00:03:10,199 --> 00:03:11,759
were harmed,

35
00:03:11,879 --> 00:03:13,759
and not a single employee was injured.

36
00:03:14,159 --> 00:03:15,639
Then we must make the local chamber of commerce

37
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:17,080
take responsibility for this.

38
00:03:17,479 --> 00:03:19,759
Also, the top floor needs urgent repairs.

39
00:03:19,759 --> 00:03:23,520
Right. The time for the top floor repairs

40
00:03:23,719 --> 00:03:24,960
and the costs must be calculated.

41
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,080
And should we shut down during that time?

42
00:03:27,199 --> 00:03:27,960
Plus,

43
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,639
we have to consider what this whole incident

44
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:30,599
will do to our hotel—

45
00:03:30,599 --> 00:03:31,599
All right, all right! Enough, enough!

46
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:33,719
I get it.

47
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:38,840
It's just one massive headache.

48
00:03:41,039 --> 00:03:43,719
Anda, everything from here on out

49
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:44,960
is entirely in your hands.

50
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,879
You must remember:

51
00:03:47,039 --> 00:03:48,319
find those people from the chamber

52
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:50,039
and negotiate compensation.

53
00:03:50,199 --> 00:03:51,599
We absolutely cannot let our hotel

54
00:03:51,599 --> 00:03:52,960
suffer any losses.

55
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,120
We've confirmed it.

56
00:04:17,439 --> 00:04:18,680
It's a grandfather and grandson.

57
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:20,160
They're ruthless,

58
00:04:20,879 --> 00:04:22,160
and they work in great sync.

59
00:04:23,639 --> 00:04:25,399
If they have other accomplices,

60
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,319
we'll be in serious trouble.

61
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:30,639
So, with Wilson's room as the center,

62
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:34,839
three o'clock to the east

63
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,720
and five o'clock to the south

64
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:39,759
are the likeliest spots for snipers.

65
00:04:41,199 --> 00:04:42,600
As for the hospital's north and west,

66
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:44,920
those are just entrances and exits.

67
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,879
Post more people on patrol.

68
00:04:47,439 --> 00:04:49,759
Don't let them slip in disguised.

69
00:04:51,199 --> 00:04:52,000
Got it.

70
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,800
Wei Tian, look.

71
00:05:03,439 --> 00:05:06,439
Wilson isn't out of danger yet.

72
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:09,600
He can't be moved from this hospital.

73
00:05:10,959 --> 00:05:12,040
There's still a bullet inside him

74
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,000
that hasn't been removed.

75
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:16,120
In a few days, he has a major surgery.

76
00:05:17,519 --> 00:05:18,759
If the surgery is successful,

77
00:05:19,399 --> 00:05:20,519
he'll wake up.

78
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,560
If it fails,

79
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,319
the Chamber of Commerce will dissolve.

80
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,120
As long as there's a glimmer of hope,

81
00:05:36,879 --> 00:05:38,759
I have to keep Wilson alive.

82
00:05:40,439 --> 00:05:42,560
Wei Tian, you must help me

83
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:45,160
ensure this surgery succeeds.

84
00:05:46,199 --> 00:05:47,319
I'll definitely help you.

85
00:05:48,879 --> 00:05:50,000
But you know me.

86
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:52,519
I don't want to be used,

87
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:54,720
especially

88
00:05:55,399 --> 00:05:56,399
by my own good friend.

89
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,600
I want to know

90
00:06:06,399 --> 00:06:07,759
why Wilson was targeted.

91
00:06:08,319 --> 00:06:09,480
Can you tell me?

92
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,279
All right.

93
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,480
Port freight and logistics

94
00:06:15,839 --> 00:06:17,720
are the Chamber's main foreign trade.

95
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,120
Eighty percent of the Chamber's revenue

96
00:06:20,639 --> 00:06:21,800
comes from right here.

97
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,199
But someone went behind Wilson's back,

98
00:06:25,439 --> 00:06:26,319
using the shipments

99
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,319
to smuggle drugs.

100
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:31,000
That person is Yars.

101
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:35,399
Once Wilson found out,

102
00:06:36,759 --> 00:06:39,079
Yars immediately sent hitmen to kill him.

103
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,439
First, they tampered with his car,

104
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,560
and then bribed a chef

105
00:06:44,399 --> 00:06:45,560
to poison his food.

106
00:06:45,839 --> 00:06:47,439
What about this batch of drugs?

107
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,079
What did Wilson do with it?

108
00:06:49,519 --> 00:06:51,279
Yars already took the buyer's money.

109
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:54,240
If he doesn't deliver the goods,

110
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,759
they definitely won't let him off.

111
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,600
But now he's pinned all the blame

112
00:06:58,600 --> 00:06:59,759
onto Wilson.

113
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,360
This meeting was originally meant

114
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,079
to force Yars

115
00:07:04,079 --> 00:07:05,000
to hand over the money

116
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,759
and find the mastermind behind him.

117
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:09,720
But Yars refuses to see reason.

118
00:07:09,959 --> 00:07:11,360
Not only is he shielding that person,

119
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,839
he even wants to kill Wilson

120
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,240
and take his place.

121
00:07:30,639 --> 00:07:31,800
What are you doing here?

122
00:07:31,959 --> 00:07:34,160
The incident at Plato Hotel is over.

123
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:36,040
Why are you still keeping tabs on Wei Tian?

124
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:38,519
Nothing.

125
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:40,199
I'm just curious.

126
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:43,040
Your tailing skills are terrible.

127
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,439
Wei Tian spotted you ages ago.

128
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:45,920
I've already been

129
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:47,120
here for a long time,

130
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:48,519
and he hasn't noticed me.

131
00:07:49,759 --> 00:07:52,759
There's nothing here but containers and sand.

132
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:54,439
What's worth your attention?

133
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:56,319
Did you think

134
00:07:56,319 --> 00:07:58,120
there was just broken containers and sand?

135
00:07:58,879 --> 00:08:00,319
There are drugs inside the containers.

136
00:08:00,879 --> 00:08:02,360
I want to see who comes to pick them up.

137
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:08,600
So there are unclaimed drugs here.

138
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:12,160
Xiang Lai, thank you so much

139
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,560
for giving us this intel.

140
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,360
You were just pumping me for information!

141
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:18,680
As for us,

142
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,279
we also want to see

143
00:08:20,279 --> 00:08:21,720
what kind of person Sass really is.

144
00:08:22,199 --> 00:08:23,319
We also want to know

145
00:08:23,639 --> 00:08:25,759
who our opponent is this time.

146
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:28,800
Knowing your enemy is never a bad idea.

147
00:08:30,439 --> 00:08:32,519
Sha Lan, looks like we can head back.

148
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,320
With Xiang Lai keeping watch here,

149
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,600
we won't miss a thing.

150
00:08:36,639 --> 00:08:37,440
Let's go.

151
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:40,039
Your chamber's business

152
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:42,600
is not my place to interfere in.

153
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:45,039
If I'm not mistaken,

154
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:47,879
you already told Wilson

155
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,559
to destroy these drugs, right?

156
00:08:55,799 --> 00:08:58,360
So let's divide and conquer.

157
00:08:58,679 --> 00:08:59,759
You deployed this many people

158
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:02,039
hoping to flush out the mastermind.

159
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:03,440
While my responsibility

160
00:09:03,639 --> 00:09:05,879
is to keep Wilson safe.

161
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:16,879
The assassin has been found.

162
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,320
The assassin has been found!

163
00:09:40,559 --> 00:09:42,320
Looks like they move pretty fast.

164
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:44,159
We need to gather

165
00:09:44,159 --> 00:09:46,039
more intel on their inner circle.

166
00:09:46,399 --> 00:09:48,720
I never expected this outcome.

167
00:09:51,320 --> 00:09:52,559
The forces behind them

168
00:09:52,799 --> 00:09:53,840
are indeed very powerful.

169
00:09:58,279 --> 00:09:59,879
Just what method do they plan to use

170
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,320
to assassinate Wilson?

171
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:03,480
I've already sent people

172
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:05,279
to protect Wilson.

173
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,519
Let's go.

174
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,039
Uncle Shengli.

175
00:10:13,519 --> 00:10:15,919
The Silent Protectors only work for money.

176
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:16,799
Why get involved

177
00:10:16,799 --> 00:10:18,279
in the local chamber of commerce's business?

178
00:10:19,399 --> 00:10:20,240
Because...

179
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,679
we keep a low profile,

180
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:25,480
and our success rate is pretty high.

181
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,679
So a lot of people

182
00:10:27,679 --> 00:10:29,000
prefer to hire us.

183
00:10:30,759 --> 00:10:31,799
I'm really curious.

184
00:10:32,480 --> 00:10:33,519
Why would someone like you

185
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:35,679
answer to Wei Tian?

186
00:10:37,639 --> 00:10:38,879
Do you really want to know?

187
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,399
Because...

188
00:10:42,759 --> 00:10:44,039
he's older than you.

189
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:50,039
Why don't you join Zhong'an instead?

190
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:51,639
No way.

191
00:10:52,279 --> 00:10:53,080
Why?

192
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:55,039
Unless you can do better than Wei Tian.

193
00:10:57,879 --> 00:10:58,799
How do you know

194
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,720
I won't do better than him?

195
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,440
Then let's make a bet.

196
00:11:03,519 --> 00:11:05,200
If you lose,

197
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:07,679
you have to leave Zhong'an and join us.

198
00:11:08,759 --> 00:11:09,559
No way.

199
00:11:10,399 --> 00:11:11,360
Don't be so sure.

200
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,240
Care to bet?

201
00:11:18,559 --> 00:11:19,840
So you, young master,

202
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,440
want to have a drink with me?

203
00:11:22,679 --> 00:11:25,240
What exactly do you want from me?

204
00:11:25,919 --> 00:11:27,279
I made a bet with someone,

205
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:28,879
and I don't want to lose.

206
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:34,240
Betting that I won't die?

207
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:42,559
You might find this useful.

208
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:50,200
As you requested,

209
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,879
I've compiled information

210
00:11:51,879 --> 00:11:53,000
on everyone around Wilson.

211
00:11:53,759 --> 00:11:55,120
Is that really necessary, though?

212
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,960
Wilson is in the hospital now.

213
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,440
His safety has nothing to do

214
00:11:58,440 --> 00:11:59,639
with the Plato Hotel.

215
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:03,360
I've always had a feeling

216
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:06,480
that as long as money is involved,

217
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:08,080
the Silent Protectors will take any job.

218
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:10,000
If they get tied to crime,

219
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:11,559
I definitely won't let them off.

220
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:16,759
Actually,

221
00:12:17,559 --> 00:12:19,360
I can't stand Wei Tian either.

222
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:20,919
It's just that

223
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:22,879
recklessly intervening

224
00:12:22,879 --> 00:12:24,679
in the local chamber's dispute...

225
00:12:24,799 --> 00:12:25,840
doesn't seem right.

226
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:28,000
We can't control the chamber's affairs,

227
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:30,919
but if they use freight as a cover

228
00:12:30,919 --> 00:12:32,080
to traffic drugs,

229
00:12:32,279 --> 00:12:33,240
then it's a crime.

230
00:12:35,759 --> 00:12:36,519
But doing this...

231
00:12:36,519 --> 00:12:37,720
won't it be too dangerous?

232
00:12:38,879 --> 00:12:40,159
My gut tells me

233
00:12:40,879 --> 00:12:42,159
that taking an unconventional approach

234
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:44,320
might yield surprising results.

235
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:40,279
Get off me!

236
00:13:41,639 --> 00:13:42,960
Let go of me! Let me go!

237
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:49,799
Gandhana!

238
00:13:50,879 --> 00:13:52,279
I'm Yars!

239
00:13:53,039 --> 00:13:54,840
How dare you treat me like this!

240
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:58,120
Yars, did you find the shipment?

241
00:13:58,759 --> 00:14:00,240
Wilson isn't dead yet,

242
00:14:00,799 --> 00:14:02,039
and you haven't found the goods.

243
00:14:02,039 --> 00:14:03,600
Do you have anything to say for yourself?

244
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,480
Give me a chance.

245
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,320
I still have a plan.

246
00:14:07,639 --> 00:14:09,480
Wilson will definitely die.

247
00:14:09,799 --> 00:14:12,000
Please, give me one more chance!

248
00:14:12,559 --> 00:14:13,960
Just one chance!

249
00:14:14,799 --> 00:14:17,159
I won't let you down this time!

250
00:14:17,159 --> 00:14:18,919
This is your last chance.

251
00:14:24,879 --> 00:14:25,759
During the surgery,

252
00:14:25,799 --> 00:14:27,080
all personnel deployments

253
00:14:27,279 --> 00:14:28,320
will be at your disposal.

254
00:14:28,639 --> 00:14:29,440
Don't worry.

255
00:14:58,679 --> 00:14:59,480
Let me.

256
00:15:02,679 --> 00:15:03,840
They're your family.

257
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:04,919
Yeah.

258
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:06,600
You're Wilson's doctor.

259
00:15:06,919 --> 00:15:07,840
Who are you?

260
00:15:43,879 --> 00:15:45,440
We have your family.

261
00:16:12,480 --> 00:16:13,279
Doctor.

262
00:16:40,679 --> 00:16:42,279
Run! Run!

263
00:16:43,919 --> 00:16:44,559
Run!

264
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:51,519
Stop fighting!

265
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,600
Just run!

266
00:16:59,559 --> 00:17:01,080
Mom, don't worry, I'll be quick.

267
00:17:07,039 --> 00:17:09,119
Come on, let's go.

268
00:17:10,359 --> 00:17:11,400
Don't drag me!

269
00:17:12,039 --> 00:17:12,960
Let go of me!

270
00:17:13,039 --> 00:17:14,200
You jerk!

271
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:22,480
Stop! Stop!

272
00:17:43,359 --> 00:17:45,920
Stop! Freeze!

273
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:05,960
Let's go.

274
00:20:20,359 --> 00:20:21,160
Wei Tian.

275
00:20:21,319 --> 00:20:22,119
Sass.

276
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:24,240
The attending doctor said

277
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:26,720
someone with a photo of his family

278
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:28,839
claimed to be Xiang Lai from Zhong'an.

279
00:20:29,279 --> 00:20:30,240
He gave his word

280
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:31,559
that he'd protect his family.

281
00:20:31,559 --> 00:20:34,480
Xiang Lai? That's impossible.

282
00:20:35,079 --> 00:20:35,880
Wei Tian.

283
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:37,200
I heard that you and Xiang Lai

284
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:38,119
have bad blood between you.

285
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:39,480
He could very well be targeting you.

286
00:20:39,480 --> 00:20:40,440
I don't think Xiang Lai

287
00:20:41,319 --> 00:20:42,400
would ever do that.

288
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:44,000
Whatever the case may be,

289
00:20:44,559 --> 00:20:45,920
we must find them as soon as possible.

290
00:20:46,839 --> 00:20:48,400
I only believe what I see with my own eyes.

291
00:20:49,119 --> 00:20:51,920
Besides, whoever is pulling the strings

292
00:20:53,480 --> 00:20:55,039
won't let them off either.

293
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:56,279
All right.

294
00:21:02,119 --> 00:21:02,920
Mr. Wei.

295
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:04,960
Where's Xiang Lai?

296
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,000
I'm looking for him too.

297
00:21:07,880 --> 00:21:09,720
He called me three hours ago

298
00:21:09,920 --> 00:21:11,240
and told me to meet him nearby.

299
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:13,279
But he still hasn't shown up.

300
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:15,200
Have you been trying to reach him too?

301
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:16,799
I've been calling him,

302
00:21:17,039 --> 00:21:18,000
but he isn't answering.

303
00:21:28,759 --> 00:21:29,880
This is Xiang Lai's phone.

304
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:32,519
Anda.

305
00:21:35,160 --> 00:21:36,599
Xiang Lai, I've been looking everywhere.

306
00:21:36,599 --> 00:21:37,920
Why aren't you answering? Where are you?

307
00:21:38,680 --> 00:21:40,359
Anda, it's Wei Tian.

308
00:21:41,039 --> 00:21:42,319
Where... Where is he?

309
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:43,440
Why are you looking for him?

310
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:46,480
I'm not the one looking for him.

311
00:21:46,799 --> 00:21:48,599
People from the chamber came to our hotel.

312
00:21:48,599 --> 00:21:49,440
They said they're looking for him.

313
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:51,039
They said he took someone.

314
00:21:52,200 --> 00:21:53,160
Apparently someone who holds

315
00:21:53,160 --> 00:21:54,559
Wilson's life in their hands.

316
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:57,160
Seems like it's a kid.

317
00:21:58,599 --> 00:21:59,519
Okay, got it.

318
00:21:59,519 --> 00:22:01,000
Thanks. Gotta go.

319
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:03,839
Any news on Xiang Lai?

320
00:22:03,839 --> 00:22:04,480
Yes.

321
00:22:05,319 --> 00:22:07,559
Xiang Lai is with a kid.

322
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:10,480
That kid is the attending doctor's child.

323
00:22:12,000 --> 00:22:13,119
Then where could he be?

324
00:22:14,240 --> 00:22:15,039
No idea.

325
00:22:15,920 --> 00:22:17,839
I need to go find him right away.

326
00:22:17,839 --> 00:22:18,480
Okay.

327
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:21,440
Shen Yu, keep the phone on you.

328
00:22:22,079 --> 00:22:23,799
Let's stay in touch.

329
00:22:24,319 --> 00:22:25,119
Okay.

330
00:22:33,200 --> 00:22:34,920
Why are you eavesdropping on me?

331
00:22:35,720 --> 00:22:36,920
Who are you calling?

332
00:22:37,559 --> 00:22:38,200
A friend.

333
00:22:40,039 --> 00:22:42,240
Anda, you should know.

334
00:22:42,680 --> 00:22:44,799
Xiao Chuan is only in it for the money.

335
00:22:44,880 --> 00:22:46,359
He'll take on any client.

336
00:22:46,559 --> 00:22:49,039
But you're different. You have a brain.

337
00:22:49,559 --> 00:22:50,319
You should understand

338
00:22:50,319 --> 00:22:51,799
just how serious this situation is.

339
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:55,799
What situation? How serious could it be?

340
00:22:56,279 --> 00:22:57,559
Those bodyguards out there,

341
00:22:58,799 --> 00:23:01,119
they don't seem to be here to protect us.

342
00:23:02,640 --> 00:23:04,400
Yeah, they're not here to protect us.

343
00:23:04,480 --> 00:23:05,599
But we have Xiang Lai.

344
00:23:05,599 --> 00:23:06,359
Xiang Lai?

345
00:23:06,920 --> 00:23:08,480
They tore through all of Xiang Lai's things,

346
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:09,440
and now they're just waiting out there.

347
00:23:11,279 --> 00:23:12,880
Did Xiang Lai do something

348
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:15,359
to piss off the local chamber of commerce?

349
00:23:15,599 --> 00:23:16,640
Is that why they're—

350
00:23:17,640 --> 00:23:19,160
Stop asking about Xiang Lai.

351
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:20,839
He never belonged to our company anyway.

352
00:23:21,279 --> 00:23:22,240
You don't need to worry.

353
00:23:22,559 --> 00:23:23,359
Wait...

354
00:23:25,920 --> 00:23:26,640
Stop right there!

355
00:23:26,640 --> 00:23:27,599
Stop following me!

356
00:23:30,720 --> 00:23:31,599
I'm not a bad guy.

357
00:23:31,599 --> 00:23:32,680
Your dad sent me to save you.

358
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:34,119
You... you're lying!

359
00:23:34,359 --> 00:23:35,160
Hold on!

360
00:23:38,839 --> 00:23:39,599
Do you believe me now?

361
00:23:44,519 --> 00:23:47,559
Then... can you take me to see my dad?

362
00:23:49,079 --> 00:23:50,039
As long as you trust me.

363
00:23:56,880 --> 00:23:57,680
Wei Tian.

364
00:23:58,000 --> 00:23:59,319
You need to find Xiang Lai right away.

365
00:24:00,079 --> 00:24:01,680
The lead surgeon operating on Wilson

366
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:02,839
doesn't trust Sass.

367
00:24:03,319 --> 00:24:04,759
He insists on seeing his family

368
00:24:04,759 --> 00:24:05,920
before stepping into the OR.

369
00:24:05,960 --> 00:24:07,640
Find a way to convince the doctor

370
00:24:07,640 --> 00:24:09,400
to operate on Wilson. Right.

371
00:24:09,400 --> 00:24:11,920
I'll have Sha Lan track down Xiang Lai.

372
00:24:13,079 --> 00:24:14,799
Got it. Understood.

373
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:20,519
I wouldn't refuse to treat him otherwise!

374
00:24:20,799 --> 00:24:22,960
They kidnapped my wife and child!

375
00:24:24,559 --> 00:24:26,240
I've already sent men to protect them.

376
00:24:26,599 --> 00:24:27,400
Don't worry.

377
00:24:28,079 --> 00:24:29,160
They'll be fine.

378
00:24:29,160 --> 00:24:30,759
No, I don't believe you!

379
00:24:31,839 --> 00:24:33,200
If I don't see them,

380
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:34,079
then...

381
00:24:34,079 --> 00:24:36,039
I won't operate on Wilson!

382
00:24:36,039 --> 00:24:37,440
You dare threaten me?

383
00:24:37,720 --> 00:24:39,039
Even if you kill me,

384
00:24:39,720 --> 00:24:41,079
I won't do this surgery!

385
00:24:41,279 --> 00:24:43,559
Not unless you bring my child back!

386
00:24:43,960 --> 00:24:45,559
You dare bargain with me?

387
00:24:45,799 --> 00:24:48,839
Wilson is extremely weak.

388
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:49,839
He can't be moved!

389
00:24:50,079 --> 00:24:51,079
In this hospital,

390
00:24:51,160 --> 00:24:52,440
only my surgical skills

391
00:24:52,720 --> 00:24:54,519
can save his life!

392
00:24:54,720 --> 00:24:57,079
Kill me, and he dies too!

393
00:24:57,079 --> 00:24:59,200
I won't let anyone push me around!

394
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:01,160
If you don't get into that OR,

395
00:25:01,799 --> 00:25:03,400
I'll kill you right now.

396
00:25:03,839 --> 00:25:04,960
And your son.

397
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:06,640
I'm a man of my word.

398
00:25:08,079 --> 00:25:08,759
Ten.

399
00:25:08,839 --> 00:25:10,720
That kid is being hunted down right now!

400
00:25:10,720 --> 00:25:11,720
I'm begging you.

401
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:12,680
Please!

402
00:25:12,960 --> 00:25:13,759
Seven.

403
00:25:13,759 --> 00:25:15,000
You have to find him!

404
00:25:15,160 --> 00:25:16,319
I know he's still alive!

405
00:25:16,319 --> 00:25:18,799
Five. Four.

406
00:25:19,640 --> 00:25:21,039
Please, I beg you!

407
00:25:21,039 --> 00:25:22,279
I'm begging you all!

408
00:25:22,640 --> 00:25:23,599
We'll vouch for it.

409
00:25:26,559 --> 00:25:27,640
What can you do?

410
00:25:29,079 --> 00:25:30,720
We guarantee we'll rescue his son.

411
00:25:32,160 --> 00:25:33,000
Who are you?

412
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:35,559
We are the Silent Protectors.

413
00:25:36,119 --> 00:25:37,839
Why should I trust you?

414
00:25:38,480 --> 00:25:39,960
As long as the surgery goes smoothly,

415
00:25:40,599 --> 00:25:42,359
we promise

416
00:25:42,519 --> 00:25:44,079
you and your son will be reunited.

417
00:25:44,319 --> 00:25:45,640
What's your guarantee?

418
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:47,000
My life.

419
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,599
I will keep you safe

420
00:25:49,759 --> 00:25:50,920
until the surgery is over.

421
00:25:51,440 --> 00:25:52,240
Likewise,

422
00:25:52,400 --> 00:25:54,279
if you pull any tricks during the operation,

423
00:25:55,319 --> 00:25:56,960
I will kill you on the spot.

424
00:25:57,640 --> 00:25:58,799
And your son, too.

425
00:26:26,079 --> 00:26:27,880
Okay, we can operate.

426
00:26:58,240 --> 00:27:01,240
Yars, everything you've done,

427
00:27:02,160 --> 00:27:03,279
Wilson knows about it all.

428
00:27:04,759 --> 00:27:06,440
The reason he didn't pursue it

429
00:27:07,119 --> 00:27:09,000
was to give you a chance to repent.

430
00:27:10,839 --> 00:27:12,119
You'd better tell me

431
00:27:12,839 --> 00:27:14,200
where these drugs came from.

432
00:27:14,680 --> 00:27:17,720
Who are you secretly making deals with?

433
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:21,440
Sass, I went through life and death with Wilson.

434
00:27:21,599 --> 00:27:22,759
We fought our way up together.

435
00:27:23,279 --> 00:27:25,960
You're in no position to question me!

436
00:27:27,519 --> 00:27:29,680
You repeatedly sent hitmen after Wilson.

437
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:31,400
Even if Wilson lets you off,

438
00:27:32,160 --> 00:27:34,240
the local chamber will never spare you.

439
00:27:34,720 --> 00:27:37,920
Sass, Wilson's position in the chamber...

440
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:39,640
who knows whose hands it'll end up in?

441
00:27:40,119 --> 00:27:41,640
Without the chamber,

442
00:27:42,240 --> 00:27:43,440
and without Wilson,

443
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:45,319
you can't do a thing.

444
00:27:46,079 --> 00:27:47,720
No one will take you in,

445
00:27:48,160 --> 00:27:50,359
because you're utterly worthless.

446
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:52,559
You brought your men to my turf

447
00:27:52,839 --> 00:27:54,359
and think you can walk out alive?

448
00:27:55,319 --> 00:27:56,519
You're a dead man!

449
00:28:16,119 --> 00:28:18,000
Only Wilson treated you like a brother.

450
00:28:19,440 --> 00:28:21,039
Why can't you see that?

451
00:28:25,759 --> 00:28:27,039
Put out a citywide alert on Xiang Lai.

452
00:28:28,160 --> 00:28:29,200
Anyone with information

453
00:28:30,079 --> 00:28:30,759
will be rewarded.

454
00:28:35,880 --> 00:28:36,279
Move.

455
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:44,559
Move.

456
00:29:02,920 --> 00:29:03,799
Sass just issued

457
00:29:03,799 --> 00:29:05,279
a citywide manhunt for Xiang Lai.

458
00:29:05,359 --> 00:29:07,599
Could there be a misunderstanding?

459
00:29:07,880 --> 00:29:09,440
Xiang Lai can be impulsive,

460
00:29:09,640 --> 00:29:10,880
but I don't think he's stupid enough

461
00:29:10,880 --> 00:29:12,200
to lose sight of his priorities.

462
00:29:12,720 --> 00:29:14,119
Even though he often opposes us,

463
00:29:14,119 --> 00:29:14,519
I don't think

464
00:29:14,519 --> 00:29:16,200
he'd pull a stunt this big.

465
00:29:17,319 --> 00:29:18,920
We must find Xiang Lai right away.

466
00:29:51,680 --> 00:29:52,519
He's not here.

467
00:29:52,519 --> 00:29:54,000
Go search around again. Hurry!

468
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:54,680
Yes, sir.

469
00:30:14,759 --> 00:30:15,519
They were all sent by Sass

470
00:30:15,519 --> 00:30:17,079
to monitor Zhong'an's operation.

471
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:19,119
Sass suspects

472
00:30:19,400 --> 00:30:20,200
Xiang Lai kidnapped

473
00:30:20,200 --> 00:30:22,000
Wilson's doctor's son, Hu Ning,

474
00:30:22,079 --> 00:30:23,559
to threaten the local chamber of commerce.

475
00:30:26,799 --> 00:30:27,720
That's impossible.

476
00:30:29,200 --> 00:30:31,240
Xiang Lai must've found something out,

477
00:30:31,240 --> 00:30:32,319
and that's why they're hunting him.

478
00:30:33,200 --> 00:30:34,680
If he were with the child,

479
00:30:34,680 --> 00:30:35,839
the first thing he'd do

480
00:30:35,880 --> 00:30:37,640
would be to bring him here.

481
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:39,400
I tried explaining that to them,

482
00:30:39,960 --> 00:30:41,240
but they wouldn't believe a word.

483
00:30:46,079 --> 00:30:48,079
The places Xiang Lai usually frequents,

484
00:30:48,240 --> 00:30:49,079
have you searched them all?

485
00:30:49,839 --> 00:30:51,240
There's not a single lead.

486
00:30:55,279 --> 00:30:56,160
So you're saying

487
00:30:56,839 --> 00:30:58,039
he vanished into thin air?

488
00:31:18,680 --> 00:31:19,400
Two combo meals.

489
00:31:19,400 --> 00:31:20,079
All right.

490
00:31:25,039 --> 00:31:25,400
Thanks.

491
00:31:25,400 --> 00:31:26,039
Here's yours.

492
00:31:28,599 --> 00:31:29,200
What are you looking at?

493
00:31:38,720 --> 00:31:39,119
Eat up.

494
00:31:57,400 --> 00:31:58,160
It's not safe here.

495
00:31:58,759 --> 00:31:59,799
Put the burger down. Let's go.

496
00:32:27,039 --> 00:32:27,480
This way.

497
00:32:38,440 --> 00:32:40,559
After them! Over there!

498
00:32:45,279 --> 00:32:46,079
Hurry, after them!

499
00:32:50,480 --> 00:32:51,559
Where are you taking me?

500
00:32:51,559 --> 00:32:52,759
Somewhere safe.

501
00:32:53,119 --> 00:32:54,319
I'm worried my dad at the hospital

502
00:32:54,319 --> 00:32:55,480
might be in danger too.

503
00:32:55,720 --> 00:32:56,640
He'll be fine.

504
00:34:40,880 --> 00:34:42,199
Captain, this is Shen Yu.

505
00:34:42,199 --> 00:34:43,000
What's going on?

506
00:34:43,280 --> 00:34:44,440
Zhong'an has an assignment.

507
00:34:44,639 --> 00:34:46,440
Xiang Lai and I were supposed to handle it.

508
00:34:46,679 --> 00:34:48,239
But Xiang Lai has gone missing,

509
00:34:48,679 --> 00:34:50,199
and Sass's men are watching me.

510
00:34:51,280 --> 00:34:52,920
I had no choice but to ask for your help.

511
00:34:55,239 --> 00:34:56,079
Hold on a second.

512
00:34:56,079 --> 00:34:57,199
Did I hear that right?

513
00:34:57,880 --> 00:34:59,320
Is the Zhong'an Group

514
00:34:59,440 --> 00:35:02,199
asking the Silent Protectors for help?

515
00:35:02,320 --> 00:35:03,119
Is that what's happening?

516
00:35:04,800 --> 00:35:05,840
With Xiang Lai gone,

517
00:35:05,840 --> 00:35:07,079
is it really right for you to do this?

518
00:35:08,159 --> 00:35:09,559
A lot of decisions at Zhong'an

519
00:35:09,559 --> 00:35:10,760
were always made

520
00:35:10,760 --> 00:35:11,800
by Xiang Lai and me together.

521
00:35:12,320 --> 00:35:13,880
Besides, these are extraordinary times.

522
00:35:14,760 --> 00:35:16,159
Your internal issues

523
00:35:16,159 --> 00:35:17,079
are none of my business.

524
00:35:17,400 --> 00:35:18,119
But you know,

525
00:35:18,119 --> 00:35:20,880
Silent Protectors don't take just any job.

526
00:35:21,159 --> 00:35:23,760
Especially someone else's leftovers.

527
00:35:25,079 --> 00:35:26,079
Don't worry, Captain.

528
00:35:26,679 --> 00:35:27,920
This assignment fully complies with

529
00:35:27,920 --> 00:35:29,239
Supedo's legal regulations.

530
00:35:30,239 --> 00:35:32,559
And though Zhong'an took it on first,

531
00:35:33,000 --> 00:35:34,760
we'll pay the fee by the book.

532
00:35:47,880 --> 00:35:49,679
So Zhong'an acts first and asks later now.

533
00:35:49,840 --> 00:35:51,119
Usually, when the money comes in this fast,

534
00:35:51,119 --> 00:35:53,360
it's never good news. Tell me about it.

535
00:35:54,239 --> 00:35:55,920
I knew you wouldn't just sit by.

536
00:35:57,239 --> 00:35:59,119
The old chief of Supedo's Muni Tribe

537
00:35:59,119 --> 00:36:00,039
just passed away from an illness.

538
00:36:00,280 --> 00:36:01,440
His youngest son, Maidin,

539
00:36:01,639 --> 00:36:03,000
needs to hurry back for the funeral

540
00:36:03,079 --> 00:36:04,480
and take over as the new chief.

541
00:36:04,519 --> 00:36:05,599
Before he died, the old chief

542
00:36:05,599 --> 00:36:07,480
had already given this contract to Zhong'an.

543
00:36:07,599 --> 00:36:08,400
Right now, Maidin is

544
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:09,760
at school in Antilocaris.

545
00:36:10,280 --> 00:36:11,880
He's already received word from the tribe

546
00:36:12,159 --> 00:36:13,159
and will be at Plato Hotel,

547
00:36:13,159 --> 00:36:14,480
waiting for us to pick him up.

548
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:16,239
Once you get to the hotel,

549
00:36:16,360 --> 00:36:18,000
just ask for the room under my name.

550
00:36:18,400 --> 00:36:19,199
Also,

551
00:36:19,280 --> 00:36:20,480
for this escort mission,

552
00:36:20,480 --> 00:36:22,079
we've equipped you with a powerful weapon.

553
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:25,639
All right, I have to hang up now.

554
00:36:25,840 --> 00:36:27,360
I'll leave the rest to you.

555
00:36:27,440 --> 00:36:28,039
Got it.

556
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:32,199
Hurry up.

557
00:36:34,800 --> 00:36:35,119
Come on.

558
00:36:38,199 --> 00:36:38,880
What are you doing here?

559
00:36:39,039 --> 00:36:39,719
Are you off today?

560
00:36:40,079 --> 00:36:41,119
And you brought a kid, too.

561
00:36:41,119 --> 00:36:42,159
Don't ask so many questions.

562
00:36:42,159 --> 00:36:43,159
Pour us two glasses of water.

563
00:36:43,360 --> 00:36:45,559
Sure. What a cute kid.

564
00:36:45,880 --> 00:36:47,400
Hold on, coming right up.

565
00:36:48,360 --> 00:36:48,760
Here you go.

566
00:36:59,480 --> 00:37:00,280
Wei Tian.

567
00:37:00,760 --> 00:37:01,880
Xiang Lai and Hu Ning

568
00:37:02,039 --> 00:37:03,920
showed up at Zuo Feichen's restaurant.

569
00:37:12,039 --> 00:37:13,960
Water. Kid, here you go.

570
00:37:16,079 --> 00:37:17,599
Is he your friend's kid?

571
00:37:17,960 --> 00:37:19,320
He doesn't look Chinese.

572
00:37:19,639 --> 00:37:20,719
Mixed-race, right?

573
00:37:22,960 --> 00:37:23,800
It's a long story.

574
00:37:24,239 --> 00:37:25,360
Let me borrow your phone.

575
00:37:26,400 --> 00:37:27,559
Why are you sweating so much?

576
00:37:27,559 --> 00:37:29,360
Where did you go? What happened?

577
00:37:29,440 --> 00:37:30,920
Just lend me your phone first.

578
00:37:31,079 --> 00:37:32,280
Where's your phone, then?

579
00:37:32,760 --> 00:37:33,559
Lost it.

580
00:37:34,599 --> 00:37:35,719
Got snatched, didn't it?

581
00:37:35,920 --> 00:37:37,039
I just want to borrow your phone.

582
00:37:37,039 --> 00:37:38,280
Why so many questions?

583
00:37:38,280 --> 00:37:39,159
Are you lending it or not?

584
00:37:39,920 --> 00:37:42,039
Bad attitude for someone borrowing a phone.

585
00:37:42,280 --> 00:37:42,960
Who do you think you are?

586
00:37:45,199 --> 00:37:47,599
Fine, I'll lend it. I'll get it now.

587
00:37:48,639 --> 00:37:50,000
The nerve of him.

588
00:37:53,760 --> 00:37:55,239
They're inside the bar right now.

589
00:37:55,239 --> 00:37:56,639
I'm keeping an eye on them from outside.

590
00:37:57,000 --> 00:37:58,519
Hurry and send someone over.

591
00:38:08,440 --> 00:38:09,000
Shen Yu.

592
00:38:09,360 --> 00:38:11,679
Mr. Zhao, you finally reached out.

593
00:38:12,840 --> 00:38:13,400
Sounds good.

594
00:38:13,519 --> 00:38:15,760
I'll take the company info and budget

595
00:38:15,760 --> 00:38:16,800
and fax them to you first.

596
00:38:17,280 --> 00:38:18,519
Look over and review them,

597
00:38:18,880 --> 00:38:20,559
then we can discuss the contract details.

598
00:38:21,079 --> 00:38:21,599
All right?

599
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:25,800
Is it because lately,

600
00:38:26,840 --> 00:38:28,639
with the big exchange rate fluctuations,

601
00:38:29,119 --> 00:38:31,079
transferring money abroad is harder?

602
00:38:31,559 --> 00:38:32,639
If the paperwork isn't complete,

603
00:38:32,639 --> 00:38:33,559
could there be trouble?

604
00:38:34,719 --> 00:38:36,880
Yes, it might be a bit troublesome.

605
00:38:39,039 --> 00:38:39,639
I understand.

606
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:44,760
Guess I can't return to Zhong'an for now.

607
00:38:50,519 --> 00:38:51,000
Come with me.

608
00:38:52,599 --> 00:38:53,440
He really isn't your kid?

609
00:38:53,440 --> 00:38:54,000
Right here!

610
00:38:54,360 --> 00:38:55,239
Quick, quick!

611
00:38:55,880 --> 00:38:56,960
Don't let them get away!

612
00:38:59,159 --> 00:39:00,639
Hurry, hurry! Block them off!

613
00:39:00,639 --> 00:39:01,320
Who the hell are they?

614
00:39:01,320 --> 00:39:01,760
Block them!

615
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:02,599
What happened?

616
00:39:02,599 --> 00:39:03,480
No time to explain.

617
00:39:03,480 --> 00:39:04,400
Take us to the tunnel, quick!

618
00:39:04,800 --> 00:39:05,440
Follow me!

619
00:39:05,800 --> 00:39:08,360
This way! Open the door! Open it!

620
00:39:08,519 --> 00:39:10,599
Open up! Open the door! Open up!

621
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,800
Hurry, move, move!

622
00:39:13,760 --> 00:39:14,400
Grab them!

623
00:39:19,360 --> 00:39:20,400
Don't let them get away!

624
00:39:20,400 --> 00:39:21,119
If Wei Tian comes,

625
00:39:21,119 --> 00:39:22,000
tell him you haven't seen us.

626
00:39:22,000 --> 00:39:22,920
W-Why?

627
00:39:22,920 --> 00:39:23,639
Just don't ask.

628
00:39:23,639 --> 00:39:24,800
Catch them! Quick!

629
00:39:25,679 --> 00:39:26,039
After them!

630
00:39:26,039 --> 00:39:26,880
Over there! After them!

631
00:39:36,199 --> 00:39:37,239
Wei Tian!

632
00:39:48,280 --> 00:39:49,519
Hurry, go!

633
00:39:53,440 --> 00:39:54,400
Where's Xiang Lai?

634
00:39:56,880 --> 00:39:58,119
Just tell me the truth.

635
00:39:58,440 --> 00:39:59,360
He... he...

636
00:40:00,079 --> 00:40:00,760
He was here.

637
00:40:01,039 --> 00:40:01,760
Where is he now?

638
00:40:02,760 --> 00:40:03,400
He left.

639
00:40:03,559 --> 00:40:04,159
Where did he go?

640
00:40:04,559 --> 00:40:06,000
He said someone was after him,

641
00:40:06,000 --> 00:40:07,599
so I let him leave through the tunnel.

642
00:40:07,719 --> 00:40:08,519
Do you need him for something?

643
00:40:19,559 --> 00:40:20,039
Go!

644
00:40:24,960 --> 00:40:25,480
Over there!

645
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:27,280
After them!

646
00:40:31,400 --> 00:40:32,559
That way, hurry!

647
00:40:37,960 --> 00:40:38,280
Move!

648
00:41:10,400 --> 00:41:11,239
Let go of me!

649
00:41:23,079 --> 00:41:24,039
You're the one who hit me!

650
00:41:24,159 --> 00:41:25,480
I was walking just fine, and you hit me!

651
00:41:25,480 --> 00:41:26,159
I really didn't mean to!

652
00:41:26,159 --> 00:41:27,280
I have to get to work soon!

653
00:41:27,320 --> 00:41:28,199
You hit me,

654
00:41:28,199 --> 00:41:28,880
how am I supposed to get to work now?

655
00:41:28,880 --> 00:41:29,800
I'll compensate you.

656
00:41:29,800 --> 00:41:30,280
You have to pay me!

657
00:41:30,280 --> 00:41:30,800
Calm down.

658
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:31,599
The car's damaged, too!

659
00:41:31,599 --> 00:41:32,360
All right, all right.

660
00:41:32,360 --> 00:41:33,760
Why are you touching me? Don't touch me!

661
00:41:33,840 --> 00:41:34,400
Are you paying or not?

662
00:41:34,400 --> 00:41:35,840
Let's just talk this through, okay?

663
00:42:17,599 --> 00:42:18,280
Hu Ning

664
00:42:31,280 --> 00:42:34,119
Wei Tian, the surgery is about to end.

665
00:42:34,679 --> 00:42:36,000
If you fail to bring

666
00:42:36,159 --> 00:42:37,719
Xiang Lai and the kid here as agreed,

667
00:42:38,760 --> 00:42:40,119
then you're the one breaking our deal.

668
00:42:40,440 --> 00:42:41,239
Rest assured.

669
00:42:41,360 --> 00:42:42,960
I'll deliver on my promise.

670
00:42:43,400 --> 00:42:44,199
Don't worry.

671
00:42:49,440 --> 00:42:50,119
Xiang Lai,

672
00:42:50,719 --> 00:42:52,199
why did that guy save us,

673
00:42:52,199 --> 00:42:53,719
only to keep chasing after us?

674
00:42:54,360 --> 00:42:55,440
Right now, besides me,

675
00:42:55,440 --> 00:42:57,239
you can't trust anyone. Understand?

676
00:42:57,559 --> 00:42:59,480
I hear him calling out for us nearby.

677
00:42:59,800 --> 00:43:01,760
Xiang Lai, if you can hear me,

678
00:43:02,719 --> 00:43:03,760
you don't have to come out.

679
00:43:04,880 --> 00:43:05,880
But you must

680
00:43:06,159 --> 00:43:08,519
take Hu Ning to his dad at the hospital.

681
00:43:09,199 --> 00:43:10,760
I want to wait for my dad by the hospital.

682
00:43:10,800 --> 00:43:12,000
Once he's out of surgery,

683
00:43:12,159 --> 00:43:14,199
I want to be the first person he sees.

684
00:43:16,039 --> 00:43:17,840
All right, let's head to the hospital.
